WEBVTT

00:04:29.520 --> 00:04:31.260
I know it's difficult, eh?

00:04:31.284 --> 00:04:33.191
(Laughter)

00:04:33.215 --> 00:04:35.410
But, of course, I don't
expect you to do that.

00:04:35.434 --> 00:04:38.563
You would all be uncomfortable
and embarrassed.

00:04:38.587 --> 00:04:42.399
And so imagine an 11-year-old girl
in the Middle East

00:04:42.423 --> 00:04:45.187
who was not educated about sexuality,

00:04:45.211 --> 00:04:47.395
who was taken from her comfort zone,

00:04:47.419 --> 00:04:48.632
her family,

00:04:48.656 --> 00:04:52.680
who witnessed the execution
of her father and brothers,

00:04:52.704 --> 00:04:54.549
having to describe in detail

00:04:54.573 --> 00:05:00.326
the rape that she faced in a culture
where talking about sexuality is taboo.